","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 32 of those years, and November to December in 35. In 2025, January to February ran 47% of normal on the middle, while June to July ran 176%. Grid 27141 had its driest year in 1976 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
